":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:6::0":{"text":"領主の腕飾り","source_cn":"领主阿邦德的手链","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F1A5E021AFA127C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1521035006:0":{"text":"――見よ！これは<style=\"highlight\">領主の腕飾り</style>じゃ。余の名前が彫られているだろう！","source_cn":"——看！<style=highlight>领主的手链<...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE592FFF25FA92B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1521035007:0":{"text":"父ヘルンニが刻んだ文字だ。ホーリンの者なら、父の字を知らないはずはない。","source_cn":"这是我父亲赫伦尼亲手刻上去的，所有呼临人都认识他的字迹。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26AE8BCC1077ED1C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1521035008:0":{"text":"これで、余が誰か分かっただろう？","source_cn":"看到它，你就该知道我是谁了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3539BB89B1DFAD2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1521035009:0":{"text":"本当に領主様なのですね……！ああ、豊穣神様のお導きに感謝！","source_cn":"……丰饶神保佑，您真是领主殿下！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51218526B894391B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1521035010:0":{"text":"それで、軍の急報とはなんだ？","source_cn":"对。所以是什么军情？快点告诉我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA78EE9ED4566A8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1521035011:0":{"text":"ですが……議事官殿にお伝えしろと言われておりまして……","source_cn":"可……我接到的命令是汇报给议事官……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3EEB04D87D265F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:14:1521035011":{"text":"ですが……議事官殿にお伝えしろと言われておりまして……","source_cn":"可……我接到的命令是汇报给议事官……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3EEB04D87D265F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1521035012:0":{"text":"ま、まさか！","source_cn":"不，我当然不敢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x676D066A6C20C2DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1521035015:0":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">タオトス峡谷の歩哨所</style>が、獣の群れに襲われていて、<style=\"highlight\">至急援軍</style>が必要なんです！","source_cn":"<style=highlight>驻守塔欧妥斯深壑的哨...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36DD2ED89EFABFA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1521035016:0":{"text":"援軍か……ならペ